<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:36:26 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>itch 一周游戏汇：11月2日-11月8日（下）</title><link>https://indienova.com/indie-game-news/itch-new-games-summary-of-last-week-2026-1102-1108-part2</link><description>indienova 盘点了 11 月 2 日至 8 日上架 itch.io 的新游戏下半部分，含多款用 Godot 开发的独立作品，适合想找灵感或参考玩法的开发者翻一翻。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:08:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">0b6507f925a39770a9122afa574bbb7f68cce34f</guid><source url="https://indienova.com/indie-game-news/itch-new-games-summary-of-last-week-2026-1102-1108-part2">indienova 独立精神</source></item><item><title>我用 Twine 做了一款文字恐怖游戏，以及下次会怎么做不同</title><link>https://dev.to/rudy_goes_8411f537b584741/how-i-made-a-text-horror-game-in-twine-and-what-id-do-differently-1mk9</link><description>一位数据分析师分享用 Twine 与 SugarCube 独立完成文字恐怖游戏《FINAL CUT》的经验，包括分支叙事、状态与音效的实现与复盘。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:52:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">a0bab37982a31bc8edf123da8f53514a610a8865</guid><source url="https://dev.to/rudy_goes_8411f537b584741/how-i-made-a-text-horror-game-in-twine-and-what-id-do-differently-1mk9">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>如何给手游应用瘦身：一份实用指南</title><link>https://dev.to/aplusgamesstudio/how-to-reduce-mobile-game-app-size-a-practical-guide-10ie</link><description>先测再砍：贴图通常是手游体积的大头，其次是音频与模型，文章给出逐项压缩与取舍的实操方法。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b8ac34a92aae50885ab55243a4b375950e479292</guid><source url="https://dev.to/aplusgamesstudio/how-to-reduce-mobile-game-app-size-a-practical-guide-10ie">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>BOXERBOTS 招募志愿开发者：UE5 第一人称多人机器人格斗游戏</title><link>https://gamedev.net/forums/topic/720842-boxerbots-looking-for-volunteer-game-developers</link><description>开发者用 Unreal Engine 5.8 做第一人称多人机器人格斗游戏 BOXERBOTS，正在招募志愿者加入团队，适合想参与多人项目练手的开发者留意。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:50:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f5577d45f4a221dd63c2e642162b85012c1c7608</guid><source url="https://gamedev.net/forums/topic/720842-boxerbots-looking-for-volunteer-game-developers">GameDev.net</source></item><item><title>打造 Meu Acervo 3D：一个面向 3D 创作者的开源资源中心</title><link>https://dev.to/lucas_oliveira_d1efc2dbeb/building-meu-acervo-3d-an-open-source-hub-for-3d-creators-7c3</link><description>聚合 Sketchfab、Poly Haven 等多个素材库的开源项目，还附带给创作者用的小工具。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:47:55 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">032756982a0cba664dedad2c6679da6c1bcdaabc</guid><source url="https://dev.to/lucas_oliveira_d1efc2dbeb/building-meu-acervo-3d-an-open-source-hub-for-3d-creators-7c3">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我如何在 Pixel 9 Pro 上为六骰策略游戏打造了一个“象棋引擎”式 AI</title><link>https://dev.to/russell_munn_5ab594df99db/how-i-built-a-chess-engine-style-ai-for-a-6-dice-strategy-game-natively-on-my-pixel-9-pro-5abi</link><description>独立开发者在手机上从零搭建六骰桌游的 AI 对手，用类似象棋引擎的概率模拟取代固定套路，还让 AI 读懂对手记分牌来动态调整冒险程度。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:23:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">07c83bf2563dbce3f087b3432ecc969dd9c4d022</guid><source url="https://dev.to/russell_munn_5ab594df99db/how-i-built-a-chess-engine-style-ai-for-a-6-dice-strategy-game-natively-on-my-pixel-9-pro-5abi">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>6 行 JS 屏幕震动加顿帧技巧，立刻提升游戏打击感</title><link>https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/add-instant-game-feel-with-this-6-line-js-screen-shake-hit-stop-trick-3paj</link><description>不用物理引擎，只要在渲染循环里加 6 行画布平移震动代码，就能让 2D HTML5 浏览器游戏的打击和碰撞立刻有街机般的分量。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:54:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">86d004ea67c2e49ac461f05ff4972fa872cbb325</guid><source url="https://dev.to/goutam_lambu_0a07d682a4ee/add-instant-game-feel-with-this-6-line-js-screen-shake-hit-stop-trick-3paj">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我做了 10 个 Windows 小工具，专治独立游戏开发里的枯燥杂活</title><link>https://dev.to/guillaumelessard/i-built-10-tiny-windows-tools-for-the-boring-parts-of-indie-gamedev-47pf</link><description>针对每届 game jam 都要重复的杂活——批量改图、切图集、打图集、做音效——作者各做了一个小工具，打包成套，独立开发者可以直接拿来省时间。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:44:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">37c3308304de556923951d53ab8dc3d5edd8783d</guid><source url="https://dev.to/guillaumelessard/i-built-10-tiny-windows-tools-for-the-boring-parts-of-indie-gamedev-47pf">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>《Blind Sight: Dead World》安卓试玩版：小体量僵尸生存游戏的设计课</title><link>https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/blind-sight-dead-world-demo-on-android-design-lessons-from-a-tiny-zombie-survival-game-57eb</link><description>一款第一人称僵尸生存试玩版只靠搜刮、防御、逃离三个机制成局，作者拆解了它如何用资源稀缺逼玩家做取舍，小团队做 Demo 可以照着学。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:35:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">90ad3d36373ab5d9583c62190f5d361460af2dee</guid><source url="https://dev.to/trendzbetagames/blind-sight-dead-world-demo-on-android-design-lessons-from-a-tiny-zombie-survival-game-57eb">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Unreal Engine 5.4 建筑可视化优化：Draw Call 从 10000 压到 1200 以下</title><link>https://dev.to/atlyxen_studios/unreal-engine-54-archviz-optimization-slashing-draw-calls-from-10000-to-under-1200-mk9</link><description>从 Revit 等软件导出的建筑模型动辄上万次 Draw Call，作者用分层实例化静态网格批量合并重复构件，实测把大型场景稳定在 60 帧。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:16:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">572d9fe3bb6fd46ddcb8f7bdd547f624d82eefac</guid><source url="https://dev.to/atlyxen_studios/unreal-engine-54-archviz-optimization-slashing-draw-calls-from-10000-to-under-1200-mk9">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>开发日志：做《NICHLYST》——敞开的门：33 个结局、32 项测试全过与一个诚实的保留意见</title><link>https://dev.to/koztechie/building-nichlyst-the-gate-that-stayed-open-33-endings-32-green-tests-one-honest-caveat-159b</link><description>作者在修好 704 个失败断言后，用一连串小而窄的检查验证了 33 个结局与双语字段等细节，最后坦言：阶段关卡虽全过，但设备端已知的启动报错仍未实测排除，绿色测试只证明它所证明的东西。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 21:23:40 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">d3b515350460890c97483bbe3593673b1907ce73</guid><source url="https://dev.to/koztechie/building-nichlyst-the-gate-that-stayed-open-33-endings-32-green-tests-one-honest-caveat-159b">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Clannect Engine v0.2 发布：向开源迈出重要一步</title><link>https://dev.to/yigitdemirci/clannect-engine-v02-is-here-a-major-step-towards-open-release-2p6c</link><description>Clannect Engine 迎来 v0.2 版本，在走向开源的路上又迈出关键一步，值得关注小型引擎的开发者留意它的进展。</description><pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:38:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1617a81b3cb30bb5b5cd9a6ca5b5fce00e6befd0</guid><source url="https://dev.to/yigitdemirci/clannect-engine-v02-is-here-a-major-step-towards-open-release-2p6c">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>藏在 README 里的二十一点牌桌，由 GitHub Actions 发牌</title><link>https://dev.to/kanywst/a-blackjack-table-that-lives-in-a-readme-dealt-by-github-actions-5g63</link><description>用 issue 下注、workflow 读牌、README 重绘牌面，把经典的 README 小游戏玩法搬到了二十一点上。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:45:48 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f979d3112aaa54861723cacbb179affcef2d8206</guid><source url="https://dev.to/kanywst/a-blackjack-table-that-lives-in-a-readme-dealt-by-github-actions-5g63">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>Roblox Studio 新 Beta：用文字提示生成 R15 动画，还能把旧 R6 动画转成 R15</title><link>https://dev.to/tora_scripts/roblox-dropped-a-studio-beta-that-generates-r15-animations-from-text-prompts-and-converts-old-r6-13og</link><description>Roblox 在 Studio Assistant 里上线了文字生成动画的 Beta 功能：输入动作与情绪描述即可生成最长 10 秒的 R15 人形动画，还能用神经网络把旧 R6 动画升级为 R15，适合不想从零手 K 关键帧的独立开发者。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 05:25:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">e75f7e9f19ff2aa99dc815e801e130b1094469d9</guid><source url="https://dev.to/tora_scripts/roblox-dropped-a-studio-beta-that-generates-r15-animations-from-text-prompts-and-converts-old-r6-13og">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>用 Rive 打造游戏化健身吉祥物：开发者指南</title><link>https://dev.to/uianimation/how-to-build-a-gamified-fitness-mascot-with-rive-a-developers-guide-45hp</link><description>这篇教程讲如何用 Rive 状态机做一只会随进度进化、对锻炼做出反应的互动健身吉祥物，并给出 React Native 与 Flutter 的接入做法。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:45:23 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6dae86aed95865dd5711080c208c3a0a4ac3efd6</guid><source url="https://dev.to/uianimation/how-to-build-a-gamified-fitness-mascot-with-rive-a-developers-guide-45hp">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>我们如何让 Telegram 小游戏的战斗确定化且由服务器校验</title><link>https://dev.to/codiologism/how-we-made-battles-deterministic-and-server-verified-in-a-telegram-mini-game-26l2</link><description>Seraph Legion 团队分享了他们在 Telegram 小程序里实现确定性战斗的做法：客户端只发意图、服务器决定结果并重放校验，起因是一次刷资源漏洞让他们意识到绝不能信任客户端计算。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 09:52:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">09e2ce0ebab304ae72ce022ed516eb1df1b2303c</guid><source url="https://dev.to/codiologism/how-we-made-battles-deterministic-and-server-verified-in-a-telegram-mini-game-26l2">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>日本 GCC 工程实践：优化 Unity WebGL / Emscripten JS 桥接（零拷贝文件系统与无分支查找）</title><link>https://dev.to/therichmodernmagician/engineered-in-japan-gcc-optimizing-unity-webgl-emscripten-js-bridge-zero-copy-fs-branchless-4n32</link><description>这篇技术报告拆解了 Unity WebGL 游戏里浏览器与引擎之间的 JS 桥接瓶颈，用零拷贝文件系统和无分支查找把内存占用与 CPU 负载降了下来，适合想做网页端发行的开发者参考。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:16:53 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">618a990fbe981dd0b278d5d5ebcd353ab373970f</guid><source url="https://dev.to/therichmodernmagician/engineered-in-japan-gcc-optimizing-unity-webgl-emscripten-js-bridge-zero-copy-fs-branchless-4n32">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>如何用免费套餐发布刚做好的游戏——7000 名玩家与一个挂掉的数据库带来的教训</title><link>https://dev.to/virtuarian/how-to-publish-the-game-you-just-built-on-free-tiers-lessons-from-7000-players-and-one-dead-3ail</link><description>作者复盘自己用免费云服务发布游戏的经历：排行榜、服务器与账单该怎么安排，以及数据库挂掉时学到的教训。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:28:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">7180f648159370fc0d27dbc5ec785f447c0f1200</guid><source url="https://dev.to/virtuarian/how-to-publish-the-game-you-just-built-on-free-tiers-lessons-from-7000-players-and-one-dead-3ail">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>无需下载、浏览器直玩的策略与 RPG 卡牌游戏精选（PC 与手机均可）</title><link>https://dev.to/chromaticpact/melhores-card-games-de-estrategia-e-rpg-que-rodam-direto-no-navegador-sem-baixar-nada-pc-e-celular-4e8h</link><description>一篇盘点浏览器端策略卡牌与 RPG 的文章，列出不用安装、打开即玩的卡牌游戏，适合想参考轻量卡牌玩法设计的开发者看看。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:21:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">317015a8ebc123790850b6a7239f90ec5bf2574a</guid><source url="https://dev.to/chromaticpact/melhores-card-games-de-estrategia-e-rpg-que-rodam-direto-no-navegador-sem-baixar-nada-pc-e-celular-4e8h">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>测一款位置游戏教会我们的事：哪些指标才真正说明它行得通</title><link>https://dev.to/samellis/what-we-learned-measuring-a-location-game-the-metrics-that-actually-tell-you-if-it-works-21hg</link><description>位置游戏不能照搬坐着玩的 App 那套指标，文章分享哪些数据才能真正判断这类游戏是否成立。</description><pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:53:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c963fa90cfb327d17906c1dcddc63b7101efd00e</guid><source url="https://dev.to/samellis/what-we-learned-measuring-a-location-game-the-metrics-that-actually-tell-you-if-it-works-21hg">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item></channel></rss>
